                <td valign="top"><font class="body"><blockquote><hr><b>Allaien (08-28-2001 11:06 a.m.):</b><br>Well to save Tiny some unneccasary effort, and to aid myself, I would like anyone who is interested in hitting Najena to say so here. The level range in mobs there is 13-35 so we&#39;ll take anyone 10-40 <img src="http://www.giftsplace.com/hrz/UB/Images/Default/E1.gif" border="0" valign="absmiddle"> Plus anyone else who wants to tag along and beat up Najena for awhile. And let me remind you that there is a +13% exp per kill (I think its 13....might be a bit more) Well I&#39;ll see everyone in game later.<p>Alaien<hr></blockquote><p>Hiya, everyone,<p>I&#39;d love to come along for this hunt; I suspect I&#39;d need a bit of help getting through the run - I&#39;ve still been hanging out around North Ro and Oasis, and I imagine that, as Dark Elves like to hunt me and make Hot &#39;N Spicy Toelings out of me ( <img src="http://www.giftsplace.com/hrz/UB/Images/Default/E1.gif" border="0" valign="absmiddle"> ) The guards would be more than happy to KOS me lots. I imagine getting a SOW and invisibled would take care of the problem - chance anyone&#39;d be willing to meet me somewhere a bit before the hunt and help out? <p>Thanks!<p>Sirar (who didn&#39;t ding 16 last night <img src="http://www.giftsplace.com/hrz/UB/Images/Default/E2.gif" border="0" valign="absmiddle"> )<br>15 Halfling Warrior</font></td>
